/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 750 Tm (Example Agency Audit Division) Tj
/F2 22 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 700 Tm (Audit of Example Program Controls) Tj
/F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 660 Tm (Summary of Findings) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 636 Tm (The audit examined whether the Agency maintained adequate controls over its) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 622 Tm (program funds during the period under review. We found that several controls) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 608 Tm (were not applied consistently, and that the respon-) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 594 Tm (sibility for approvals was not clearly assigned to any single office.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 570 Tm (Auditors recommend that the Agency take the following steps:) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 90 550 Tm (1. Assign a single office to approve all program payments.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 90 534 Tm (2. Reconcile the payment ledger monthly and keep the records.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 90 518 Tm (3. Train staff on the revised approval procedure.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 494 Tm (Other observations:) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 90 476 Tm (• Several files lacked a signed approval form.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 90 460 Tm (• Receipts were stored in more than one location.) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 260 40 Tm (Page 1 of 3) Tj
/F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 40 Tm (Confidential Draft) Tj
